ypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c86947761722640\" href=\"?note=0c86947761722640\" title=\"43-df-lowforschnorrtest\">43-df-lowforschnorrtest</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorrTest}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForSchnorrTest}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补足Terwijn–Zambella测试版本的核心等价；原Schnorr低性刻画的强数组修复与这里统一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lowforschnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"0c86947761722640","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforschnorrtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforschnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"0c86947761722640","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-lowforschnorrtest]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\su